---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import CategoryGrid from '../../components/CategoryGrid.astro';
import { getArticles } from '../../lib/blog';
const articles = await getArticles();
---
<Base title="模块 / 系列" active="categories">
  <div class="shell categories-page">
    <header class="page-heading"><h1>模块 / 系列</h1><p>关注变化，理解原理，动手构造，也更新自己的认知。</p></header>
    <CategoryGrid articles={articles} headingLevel="h2" />
    <div class="categories-note"><p>从一次关注，走向更深的理解。</p><span>书、访谈、博客与亲手实践，都可以成为下一篇记录的起点。</span></div>
  </div>
</Base>
